  {
   "id": "empires",
   "text": "The first empire may have been built around twenty-three hundred BC, by Sargon of Akkad. But the true age of giant empires began in five hundred fifty BC, when Cyrus the Great founded the Persian Empire, the largest the world had yet seen.",
