   "id": "market",
   "text": "Picture a market town around the year twelve hundred. Most people were farmers who rarely travelled far from home. Merchants from Venice and Genoa brought pepper, silk and sugar from distant lands. Castles, cathedrals and the first universities rose across Europe. Meanwhile, far to the east, a storm was gathering on the steppe.",
