   "id": "explore",
   "text": "Now Europe turned to the oceans. In fourteen ninety-two, Christopher Columbus sailed west, hoping to reach Asia. Instead, he reached the Caribbean. Two halves of the world that had been apart for thousands of years were suddenly connected, for better and for worse.",
